Tools: [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "add_contact_to_outlook", "description": "Add a new contact from the CRM to Microsoft Outlook.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"crm_contact_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The unique identifier of the contact in the CRM system."}, "outlook_account_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The Outlook account email to which the contact should be added."}}, "required": ["crm_contact_id", "outlook_account_id"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "sync_contact_updates", "description": "Synchronize contact updates between the CRM and Outlook.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"crm_contact_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The unique identifier of the contact in the CRM system."}, "outlook_contact_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The unique identifier of the contact in Outlook."}}, "required": ["crm_contact_id", "outlook_contact_id"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "automate_task_creation_for_follow_up", "description": "Automate the creation of a follow-up task for a contact.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"contact_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The unique identifier of the contact for whom the task is being created."}, "task_title": {"type": "string", "description": "The title of the task to be created."}, "due_date": {"type": "string", "description": "The due date for the task in ISO 8601 format."}}, "required": ["contact_id", "task_title", "due_date"]}}}]\nExample: I will proceed with adding the new client to your Outlook account, synchronizing the recent updates, and creating the required follow-up task.

<tool_call>
{"name": "add_contact_to_outlook", "arguments": {"crm_contact_id": "12345", "outlook_account_id": "user@example.com"}}
</tool_call>
<tool_call>
{"name": "sync_contact_updates", "arguments": {"crm_contact_id": "12345", "outlook_contact_id": "67890"}}
</tool_call>
<tool_call>
{"name": "automate_task_creation_for_follow_up", "arguments": {"contact_id": "12345", "task_title": "Follow-up with client", "due_date": "2023-04-15T09:00:00Z"}}
</tool_call>

Tools: [{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "reserveConferenceRoom", "description": "Reserves a conference room with specified amenities and services for a business meeting.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"center_name": {"type": "string", "description": "The name of the business center where the conference room is to be reserved."}, "reservation_date": {"type": "string", "description": "The date for which the conference room reservation is made in YYYY-MM-DD format."}, "start_time": {"type": "string", "description": "The start time of the meeting in HH:MM format."}, "end_time": {"type": "string", "description": "The end time of the meeting in HH:MM format."}, "attendee_count": {"type": "integer", "description": "The number of people expected to attend the meeting."}, "seating_arrangement": {"type": "string", "description": "The type of seating arrangement required for the meeting.", "enum": ["theater", "classroom", "conference", "u_shape"]}, "equipment_needed": {"type": "array", "description": "List of audio-visual and other technical equipment needed for the meeting.", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["audio-visual", "microphone", "projector", "whiteboard"]}}, "catering_services": {"type": "array", "description": "List of catering services required for the meeting.", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["light refreshments", "lunch", "coffee", "snacks"]}}}, "required": ["center_name", "reservation_date", "start_time", "end_time", "attendee_count", "seating_arrangement", "equipment_needed", "catering_services"]}}}]\nExample: <tool_call>
{"name": "reserveConferenceRoom", "arguments": {"center_name": "Liberty Business Center", "reservation_date": "2023-05-15", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "13:00", "attendee_count": 20, "seating_arrangement": "conference", "equipment_needed": ["audio-visual"], "catering_services": ["light refreshments"]}}
